---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---

<article class="container-x py-10 lg:py-14">
  <header class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <nav class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-4">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-brand-700">Domů</a>
      <span class="mx-2">/</span>
      <a href="/blog/" class="hover:text-brand-700">Blog</a>
      <span class="mx-2">/</span>
      <span>{{ title }}</span>
    </nav>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-3">
      {% if category %}<span class="badge bg-brand-50 text-brand-800 dark:bg-brand-900/40 dark:text-brand-200">{{ category }}</span>{% endif %}
      {% if dateModified %}<span>Aktualizováno {{ dateModified | dateCZ }}</span>{% elif date %}<span>{{ date | dateCZ }}</span>{% endif %}
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <span>{{ content | readingTime }} min čtení</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-slate-50 text-balance leading-[1.05]">{{ title }}</h1>
    {% if perex %}<p class="mt-5 text-lg sm:text-xl text-ink/75 dark:text-slate-300 text-pretty max-w-2xl">{{ perex }}</p>{% endif %}

    {% if reviewer %}
      <aside class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/40 p-4 flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-brand-gradient text-white text-lg font-bold">
          {{ reviewer.initials or "?" }}
        </div>
        <div class="text-sm">
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Odborně zkontrolováno</p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">{{ reviewer.name }}</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">{{ reviewer.role }}</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    {% endif %}

    {% if heroImage %}
      <img src="{{ heroImage }}" alt="{{ heroAlt or title }}" width="1200" height="630"
           class="mt-8 rounded-3xl w-full aspect-[16/9] object-cover shadow-card">
    {% endif %}
  </header>

  <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert lg:prose-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-10
              prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:tracking-tight
              prose-a:text-brand-700 hover:prose-a:text-brand-800
              prose-strong:text-slate-900 dark:prose-strong:text-slate-100
              prose-img:rounded-2xl">
    {{ content | safe }}
  </div>

  {# In-article AdSense slot — placed after content, before sources/CTA #}
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    {% set slot = "4874216718" %}
    {% set format = "in-article" %}
    {% include "partials/ad.njk" %}
  </div>

  {% if sources %}
    <aside class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-12 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/40 p-6">
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Zdroje</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        {% for s in sources %}
          <li>· <a href="{{ s.url }}" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="hover:text-brand-700 underline">{{ s.label }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </aside>
  {% endif %}

  <aside class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-paper dark:bg-slate-900/40 p-6 flex items-start gap-4">
    <img src="/img/logo-transparent.png" alt="" width="48" height="48" class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-flame-50 dark:bg-slate-800 p-1">
    <div class="text-sm">
      <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Redakce Ideální BMI</p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Píšeme s odkazy na WHO, CDC, NICE a ÚZIS. Klinicky citlivé texty procházejí korekturou nutričního terapeuta nebo praktického lékaře. Více o tom, jak pracujeme, na stránce <a href="/o-nas/" class="text-brand-700 hover:text-brand-800 underline">O nás</a>.</p>
      {% if dateModified %}<p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500 mt-2 text-xs">Naposledy aktualizováno {{ dateModified | dateCZ }}{% if date and dateModified != date %} · původně publikováno {{ date | dateCZ }}{% endif %}.</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </aside>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-12 rounded-3xl bg-brand-gradient p-8 text-white text-center shadow-card-lg">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold">Spočítejte si své BMI</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-brand-50/90">Přesný výpočet zdarma podle WHO. Zadejte výšku a váhu a uvidíte výsledek za 2 vteřiny.</p>
    <a href="/#kalkulacka" class="inline-flex mt-4 items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-white px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-brand-700 hover:bg-brand-50 transition shadow-card">
      Otevřít BMI kalkulačku →
    </a>
  </div>
</article>
